<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1079298/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1079299" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute>Illustrissimo atque Celeberrimo Viro Johanni <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoull<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/>Petrus Antonius <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelottus</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Literas, quas <rs key="place_GEO-2973783" type="place">Argentorati</rs> ad Te, Vir Sapientissime, dedi, Tibi fuisse
      <lb/>jam redditas nullus dubito. Promittebam me statim ac in am<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>plissim<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> hanc <rs key="place_GEO-2988507" type="place">Urb<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice></rs> pervenissem ad Te scriptur<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>; quod in
      <lb/>pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sentia, licet paulo tardius, pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sto. Primum qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ro abs
      <lb/>Te num bene valeas, quod maxime opto; inde an Clarissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mus meique amicissimus Filius tuus <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Nicolaus</rs> in <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Patriam</rs>
      <lb/>redierit; tum etiam atque etiam rogo, ne respon<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dere recuses iis difficultatibus, se<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice> objectionibus, de qui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bus mense Januario ad Te perscripsi, et quas ex nobilissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mo Comite <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Riccato</rs> fuisse profectas indicavi. Nihil gratius
      <lb/>mihi facere potes. Pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stantissim<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119062372" type="person">Varignon<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> amicum
      <lb/>summum tu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> nuper adii, qui non modo perlibenter
      <lb/>me vidit, verum etiam pluribus me cumulavit favoribus.
      <lb/>Ingeniosissim<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> Doctissimi Filii Tui <rs key="pers_DE-588-118656503" type="person">Danielis</rs> <rs key="biblio_KGZSMV2E" type="biblio">de Respi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ratione</rs> Dissertation<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> inprimis mihi dono dedit, deinde
      <lb/>ut horum <rs type="organisation">Regiorum Academicorum</rs> nobilissimo conventui
      <lb/>interessem effecit maximo meo cum honore.
      <lb/>Eminentissimus, atque Eruditissimus <rs key="pers_DE-588-119226987" type="person">Cardinalis Poligna<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cus</rs> <rs type="organisation">Regi<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Academi<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Scientiar<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> Pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ses incredibili me
      <lb/>excepit benignitate, pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tereaque facultatem in ead<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <lb/><rs type="organisation">Academia</rs> in poster<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> pro lubitu sedendi mihi generosissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>me impertivit. De Te, Vir Amicissime, Clarissimus <rs key="pers_DE-588-119062372" type="person">Vari<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gnonus</rs>, et ego honorificentissime locuti sumus, uti eti<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>
      <lb/>cum nobilissimo, meique amantissimo Viro <rs key="pers_DE-588-118941941" type="person">Antonio</rs> de Comitibus<supplied>.</supplied>
<pb facs="1079300" n="2"/>
      <lb/>Sed de his satis. Perlegenti mihi nuper meo in Opere <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">de
      <lb/>Separatione Fluidor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> in Corpore Animali</rs> pag. 67 linea X<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice>
      <lb/>proposition<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> ill<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>. <hi rend="u">Cujuslibet canalis superficies interior <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> trans<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>fluente Liquore (abstrahendo anim<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> gravitate) premitur
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualiter in omnibus partibus, qualemcunque canalis habeat figur<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>,
      <lb/>sive sit conica, sive cylindrica, sive alia qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>vis.</hi> Perlegenti, inquam,
      <lb/>mihi hanc propositionem, difficultas, de qua Te consulere statuo, <lb/>in mentem venit. Etenim sequenti ratiocinio mihi videtur de<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>monstrari posse, fals<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> esse, <hi rend="u">partes duas <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quales <formula>mn</formula>, <formula>pq</formula> ubi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>que sumptas in superficie canalis <formula>BADF</formula></hi> (vide fig. 5) <hi rend="u"><choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualem
      <lb/>pressionem <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> Liquore omnibus in locis exitum qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>rente</hi>.</p>
  <p><lb/>Quod, Te non renuente, pag. 67. linea 27, 28 mei Ope<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ris asserui. Posui tecum Liquor<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> in canali <formula>BADF</formula> premi
      <lb/>continenter, et <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualiter <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> Vi urgente ad orifici<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <formula>BF</formula>, et orifi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cium <formula>AD</formula> primo clausum esse, sed ita tamen ut Liquor ei pro<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>xime adstans, moliri exitum non intermittat intere<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>adum ab eo, qui <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> tergo insequitur continenter
      <lb/>premitur. Quibus positis, (linea 24) scripsi: <hi rend="u">pa<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tet utique quum omnia maneant in <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quilibrio, seu in statu
      <lb/>uietis, vim illam diffundi quaquaversus <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualiter, ita nempe
      <lb/>ut partes du<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quales <formula>mn</formula>, <formula>pq</formula> ubicunque sumpt<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in superfi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cie canalis <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qual<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> patiantur pression<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> Liquore omnibus
      <lb/>in locis exit<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>rente</hi>. Me<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> aut<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> ratiocini<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> est hujusmodi<supplied>:</supplied>
      <lb/>Concipe in figura 5 canalis <formula>BADF</formula> ductas ab axe <formula>HG</formula> ipsiusmet canalis
<pb facs="1079301" n="3"/>
      <lb/><formula>BADF</formula> perpendiculares <figure facs="../images/figures/1079301_01.png" hand="pers_DE-588-102552517"/>
      <lb/><formula>iLn</formula>, <formula>MN</formula> ad latus <formula>AB</formula>. Patet,
      <lb/>quando canalis est conicus,
      <lb/>perpendicular<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <formula>iL</formula> maiorem
      <lb/>esse perpendiculari <formula>MN</formula>, ideoque
      <lb/>columellam aqueam prementem partem <formula>mn</formula> canalis <formula>BADF</formula>
      <lb/>columell<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> aque<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> partem <formula>pq</formula> premente maiorem esse. Atqui
      <lb/>vis pressionis (c<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>teris paribus) maior est in maiori columella, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>m
      <lb/>in minori; ergo falsum est quod in statu sive quietis, sive
      <lb/>motus, partes <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quales <formula>mn</formula>, <formula>pq</formula> sumpt<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in superficie cana<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lis <formula>BADF</formula> <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qual<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> patiantur pression<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> Liquore omnibus in
      <lb/>locis exit<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>rente. Ut hanc me<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> perpendas difficultat<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>
      <lb/>quammaxime qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>so, et quid Tibi hac de re videatur
      <lb/>libere dicas, rogo. Cupio enim a Te continuo doceri, quanquam
      <lb/>ne Tibi molestus sim vereor in tot proponendis qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stionibus.</p>
  <closer><salute><lb/>Vale Vir Illustrissime, salutemque plurim<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> meo nomine
      <lb/>dicito Pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stantissimis Filiis Tuis <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Nicolao</rs>, et <rs type="person">Danieli</rs>.</salute> <dateline>Dab<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <add>raptim</add>
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-2988507" type="place">Parisiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1722-08-01">1. Augusti 1722.</date></dateline>
      <lb/>Rue de Petits <choice><sic>Agustines</sic><corr>Augustines</corr></choice> au l’Hotel des Monsegneurs
      <lb/>les Ambassadeurs <choice><sic>extraordinaire</sic><corr>extraordinaires</corr></choice> de la <rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Republique de Venise</rs><supplied>.</supplied></closer>
  <postscript><p>P. S.</p>
    <p>Alia in ment<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> venit difficultas, qua ostendi posse mihi videtur vim
        <lb/>pressionis in <formula>pq</formula> maior<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> esse vi pressionis in <formula>mn=pq</formula> ex hypothesi. Et<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>enim quum massula fluida, sive columella fluida, cuius axis est <formula>MN</formula> sit
        <lb/>minor columell<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> fluida, cuius basis <formula>iL</formula> (posito, canal<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <formula>BADF</formula> esse conic<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>)
        <lb/>videtur eand<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> vim pressionis utrobique applicat<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> ad impingendas
